    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So you mean to say that Hoederer has failed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, General. I saw it with my own eyes. He was gravely wounded in the battle just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And he was in contact with another Sarkaz woman, aside from his longtime mercenary acquaintance?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. But she's... highly skilled at concealment, and moves too quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was anxious about getting too close. Couldn't shake the feeling she'd notice me with one wrong step.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wise choice. You wouldn't have made it back alive otherwise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "That said, I'm surprised the Confessarius let Babel's assassin go free. Was that an oversight, or their intent?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me about Hoederer. Where is he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's still marshaling the remaining mercenaries, and about to resume pursuing the escaped convicts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have him return. Those convicts will not stay free forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "General?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you said, his wounds are no laughing matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forgive me, but why do you still trust Hoederer so much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've had you with him this whole time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct me if I'm wrong, but you've never once reported any misdeeds from him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But he used to work for Babel!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was the mercenaries under his watch that screwed up, and it was his old friend that incited them! Don't you think it's too risky to keep him in such a key position, General?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've seen for yourself today. How does one Victorian regard another?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how much more difficult do you think it is for one Sarkaz to trust another?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've had everything stolen from us, been forced to grow accustomed to fighting each other for the right to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now, we've obtained a new opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "You tell me, do you want to go back to monitoring a possible Sarkaz spy, or will you accompany me in eliminating the remaining Victorian threats?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "General, we choose to go with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
