    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*pant*... *pant*... Did we shake them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't let our guards down yet, Mr. Feist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know... *huff*... I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Captain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your face is splattered in blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blood?! Hey, Bill... Bill?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nrgh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh, it's just my own blood. No need to panic, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, Bill, you could breathe a little louder! I don't want to have spent all this effort porting a dead man back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then think about... swinging your spanner gentler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bill"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're always... hitting me... in the head...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear you. You're the boss today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on a little longer... we'll be right back home soon. Right? I'm not going blind, am I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eugh, this blood from my forehead's getting in my eyes a little... Rockrock, eyes out. How much left to our target rendezvous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A little over 300 meters and we're there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_403_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Team 6 on guard here, right? I could really use a hand from them. Bill, old bud, you're getting harder to carry by the second.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g7_subway",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...How long have we gone without a signal from the surface team?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't the Doctor say they'd only contact us after they reach that last RDV?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I mean the Self-Salvation Corps, at the one before that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "We had an agreement that they'd keep us up to date with the surface situation every half hour.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shit, I wasn't tracking the time! How long's it been?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...We need to go up and see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If the Sarkaz have already discovered our last rendezvous, then the Doctor's squad is in danger. You're clearly worried sick about Morgan and Dagda too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A... And you too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Worst comes to worst, Vina, I go peek, and you stay here. Suppose somehow something's happened, you scarper further in...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Indra, I can't always keep cowering behind you all. First our mentor, then you and the Glasgow Gang, now the Doctor\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I've cowered for far too long, and I know it. Dagda wasn't talking nonsense. If you're always tucked away in the shadows, you gradually lose the courage to directly face the sun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's trying to nark you! You know what she's dying for? You, taking her to storm the Palace, and finding that what's-his-gent to do him in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're itching to go back to the Glasgow Gang. Don't you understand her point of view?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Like hell I don't, but that's the bloody thing. I understand, and that's why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're scared she'll end up killing herself, the way she rushes it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can bloody imagine, can't you? She's got a death wish in my eyes, the way she acts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...You need to trust her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She'll be willing to live for our sake... and the sake of so many, even if it comes with enormous pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's an outstanding knight, and a warrior of Victoria. She has everything in common with the countless others who struggle to live, and fight on for Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I... I have to fight with them. Not because I'm in some special position, but because we're all 'native' to this land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Think of that commander, Lady Clovisia. Would she abandon her soldiers, run off just to keep herself safe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not familiar with her... but I don't imagine she would. Those soldiers really trust in her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then in your eyes, how much do I pale in comparison?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Like bloody hell you pale at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then follow me. Together, we'll make sure that our comrades-in-arms have a safe trip home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
