    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hold it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it, Horn? We have a visual on the exit already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mind the perimeter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Three o'clock!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.02,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Horn, it's Sarkaz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.02,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Robben, are you still fine for ammo?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha... haha... sorry, Horn. Truth is, I've been hiding an explosive shell on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "text": "All this time, I've had it in my head that if I fall into the enemy's hands at some point again... I'll be taking this shell with me to my last stand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Shame, we improvised that shell ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How's that got anything to do with\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm very sorry, but I'm not inclined to give you that opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? My shell\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
