    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like the power of a homemade one falls a bit short after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... but he's unscathed, how?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Sarkaz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robben"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Sarkaz is their beloved General.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We finally meet. An improvised shell is hardly a suitable greeting though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you've met your share of Victorian soldiers, Sarkaz. After all, a great deal of them died by your hands. I imagine their spirits are practically lining up to crowd your dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to be so self-effacing, White Wolf of Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even to the Sarkaz, you qualify as a heroic warrior.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I recall, the captain who rendered Kazdel a sea of flames once more, two hundred years ago, was your ancestor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you some monster who's lived for centuries too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had no chance to witness that war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But listen to the way you talk about it. It's no different from your kin who feed on others' lives to prolong their own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Those stained in Sarkaz blood must pay that blood back, thousands of times over.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where do you think we came from, Victorian? Just who runs in fear at the restless souls circling Londinium's skies day and night, murmuring their blood feuds?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you know? I became a professional soldier precisely because I was fed up with justifying this war we're in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "The words of the deceased lingering about my ears are more than you'll ever hear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I promised them... I promised them this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not fall until I see my people out of this place alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
